\newlabel{fig:scope_stability}{{8}{11}{Digital Storage Oscilloscope Waveforms (Tektronix TBS 2000B Series) of the AC-coupled output node under full load ($100\text { mA}$). Across a 50-fold magnification from $1.00\text { V/div}$ down to $20.0\text { mV/div}$, the trace confirms robust closed-loop stability with zero periodic limit cycles, ringing, or self-oscillation, exhibiting only minor ambient laboratory noise ($\approx 24\text { mV}_{p-p}$)}{figure.caption.15}{}}
